m(5, 9)\n    assert stock_of(\"5\") == 0\n\n\ndef test_stock_of_returns_int_type():\n    \"\"\"stock_of should return an int for both present and absent skus.\"\"\"\n    add_item(11, 4)\n    assert isinstance(stock_of(11), int)\n    assert isinstance(stock_of(99999), int)",
